---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Stream — Greg O'Brien" current={3}>
<div data-screen-label="Stream archive">
<div data-hero="1" style="border-top:1px solid var(--edge);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:38px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr">
<div data-hero-left="1" style="padding:96px 56px 84px;border-right:1px solid var(--rule)">
<div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Stream</div>
<h1 style="margin:18px 0 0;font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:54px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em">Half-thoughts,<br>kept in <span style="font-style:italic">order</span>.</h1>
</div>
<div data-hero-right="1" style="padding:calc(96px + 32.5px) 56px 84px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;max-width:46ch;color:var(--body)">One line at a time. Things I've noticed, half-formed ideas, quick thoughts that might lead somewhere later. Newest first, nothing deleted.</p>
<div style="display:flex;gap:18px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted)"><span>14 entries</span><span>·</span><a href="/think" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none" class="h-ul">Notes</a></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="padding:40px 56px 14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline">
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">September 2026</span>
<a href="/" style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s ease" class="h-ink">Home →</a>
</div>
<div style="padding:14px 56px 20px;max-width:78ch;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Sep 15</span><span>Leadership begins where explanation becomes recommendation.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Sep 11</span><span>Ownership sounds like a decision followed by a next step.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Sep 08</span><span>Complexity is real, but it does not excuse confusion.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Sep 04</span><span>Simplicity is often the final result of difficult thinking.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Sep 01</span><span>A useful model leaves something out on purpose.</span></div>
</div>
<div style="padding:20px 56px 14px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">August 2026</div>
<div style="padding:14px 56px 44px;max-width:78ch;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Aug 28</span><span>Tools can extend judgment, but they cannot replace it.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Aug 25</span><span>Automation should remove friction without removing character.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Aug 21</span><span>A system is only useful if it survives an ordinary week.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Aug 18</span><span>Making something teaches what studying cannot.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Aug 14</span><span>The real test of understanding is whether I can explain why.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Aug 11</span><span>Evidence is useful, but not everything meaningful is measurable.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Aug 07</span><span>Curiosity is productive even when it produces no deliverable.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Aug 04</span><span>I can prepare without waiting to feel completely ready.</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Aug 01</span><span>Begin with what can be finished.</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</Layout>
